v 3
d fedesc: Fixed-effect sample descriptives
d
d Reports how high-dimensional fixed effects change the estimation sample.
d For a no-fixed-effect baseline and up to five fixed-effect specifications,
d fedesc shows observation counts, shares of the baseline, descriptive
d statistics, and distinct-entity counts (with retained shares), optionally
d within categories of a by() variable. The singleton-dropping sample matches
d that of reghdfe.
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.0 or later
d
d Author: Jan Jakob Krueger
d Support: email info@jjkrueger.de
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260812
d
f fedesc.ado
